>
<p>
	My purpose for making this is not yet know, even to myself. It exists purely because
	I can create it. I have a tendency to ramble, so I imagine this is a sort of outlet
	that I can use to release that slurry, while at the same time sparing my poor friends
	and family from the hours of nonesense I produce. Should you find this interesting,
	feel free to read whatever you like. The philosophy section tends to have deeper thoughts,
	while development is about coding projects. Schizo is something you can look at if you
	do not care for your own well being.
</p>
<br/>
<p>Enjoy.</p>
	
